    "Adjusts the bright parts of the picture. Hold Option to see clipped highlights.": {
      "comment": "UI display text. Keep numbered placeholders and keyboard shortcuts intact. Compositor/UI/CameraRawControls.swift",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
