    "Bake keeps the current masked appearance in the dependent layers’ pixels. Remove Links reveals their pixels. You can undo either choice.": {
      "comment": "UI display text. Keep numbered placeholders and keyboard shortcuts intact. Compositor/Document/LiveLayerMask.swift",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "„Einrechnen“ erhält das aktuelle maskierte Aussehen in den Pixeln der abhängigen Ebenen. „Verknüpfungen entfernen“ blendet deren Pixel ein. Beide Optionen lassen sich rückgängig machen."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bake keeps the current masked appearance in the dependent layers’ pixels. Remove Links reveals their pixels. You can undo either choice."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Aplicar conserva el aspecto actual de las máscaras en los píxeles de las capas dependientes. Eliminar vínculos revela sus píxeles. Ambas opciones se pueden deshacer."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Appliquer conserve l’aspect masqué actuel dans les pixels des calques dépendants. Supprimer les liens fait réapparaître leurs pixels. Les deux opérations peuvent être annulées."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "「適用」は、参照先レイヤーのピクセルに現在のマスクの見た目を反映します。「リンクを削除」は元のピクセルを表示します。どちらの操作も取り消せます。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "적용하면 이 마스크를 참조하는 레이어의 픽셀에 현재 마스크 모양이 반영됩니다. 링크를 제거하면 원래 픽셀이 드러납니다. 어느 쪽이든 실행 취소할 수 있습니다."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Aplicar preserva a aparência atual das máscaras nos pixels das camadas dependentes. Remover vínculos revela seus pixels. Ambas as opções podem ser desfeitas."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "“栅格化”将当前蒙版效果固化到关联图层的像素中；“移除链接”将显示被蒙版隐藏的像素。两种操作均可撤销。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "「點陣化」將目前遮色片效果固化到關聯圖層的像素中；「移除連結」將顯示被遮色片隱藏的像素。兩種操作均可還原。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
