    "How much the curve also changes color strength. Zero matches Photoshop; lower keeps it to brightness, higher adds more color.": {
      "comment": "UI display text. Keep numbered placeholders and keyboard shortcuts intact. Compositor/UI/CameraRawColorControls.swift",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wie stark die Kurve auch die Farbstärke verändert. Null entspricht Photoshop; niedrigere Werte beschränken sich auf die Helligkeit, höhere verstärken die Farbe."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "How much the curve also changes color strength. Zero matches Photoshop; lower keeps it to brightness, higher adds more color."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cuánto modifica la curva la intensidad del color. Cero coincide con Photoshop; los valores menores limitan el efecto al brillo y los mayores añaden más color."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Influence de la courbe sur l’intensité des couleurs. Zéro correspond à Photoshop ; les valeurs basses privilégient la luminosité, les valeurs élevées renforcent la couleur."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "カーブが色の強さにも影響する度合いです。0 は Photoshop と同じで、低い値は明るさの変化を中心とし、高い値は色も強めます。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "곡선이 색상의 강도에도 영향을 주는 정도입니다. 0은 Photoshop과 같고, 낮추면 밝기 위주로 바뀌며 높이면 색상도 더 강해집니다."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Quanto a curva altera a intensidade da cor. Zero corresponde ao Photoshop; valores menores limitam o efeito ao brilho e valores maiores adicionam mais cor."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "曲线对颜色强度的影响。零对应 Photoshop 的效果；较低值偏重明亮度调整，较高值增加颜色强度。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "曲線對顏色強度的影響。零對應 Photoshop 的效果；較低值偏重明度調整，較高值增加顏色強度。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
