    "Select layer mask; Option-click to view it alone; Shift-click to enable/disable; Cmd-click to select its black areas (Cmd-Shift adds, Cmd-Option subtracts)": {
      "comment": "UI display text. Keep numbered placeholders and keyboard shortcuts intact. Compositor/UI/NativeLayerList.swift",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ebenenmaske auswählen; Option-Klick: einzeln anzeigen; Umschalt-Klick: aktivieren/deaktivieren; Cmd-Klick: schwarze Bereiche auswählen (Cmd-Umschalt: hinzufügen, Cmd-Option: abziehen)"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Select layer mask; Option-click to view it alone; Shift-click to enable/disable; Cmd-click to select its black areas (Cmd-Shift adds, Cmd-Option subtracts)"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Seleccionar máscara de capa; Opción-clic para verla sola; Shift-clic para activar o desactivar; Cmd-clic para seleccionar sus áreas negras (Cmd-Shift añade, Cmd-Opción resta)"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sélectionner le masque de fusion ; Option-clic : l’afficher seul ; Maj-clic : activer/désactiver ; Cmd-clic : sélectionner ses zones noires (Cmd-Maj : ajouter, Cmd-Option : soustraire)"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "レイヤーマスクを選択 · Option-クリックで単独表示 · Shift-クリックで有効・無効を切り替え · Cmd-クリックで黒い領域を選択（Cmd-Shift で追加、Cmd-Option で削除）"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "레이어 마스크 선택 · Option-클릭으로 마스크만 보기 · Shift-클릭으로 사용 여부 전환 · Cmd-클릭으로 검정 영역 선택 (Cmd-Shift 추가, Cmd-Option 빼기)"
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Selecionar máscara de camada; Option-clique para vê-la isoladamente; Shift-clique para ativar ou desativar; Cmd-clique para selecionar suas áreas pretas (Cmd-Shift adiciona, Cmd-Option subtrai)"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "选择图层蒙版；Option-单击单独查看；Shift-单击启用或停用；Cmd-单击选择黑色区域（Cmd-Shift 添加，Cmd-Option 减去）"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "選取圖層遮色片；Option-按一下單獨檢視；Shift-按一下啟用或停用；Cmd-按一下選取黑色區域（Cmd-Shift 新增，Cmd-Option 減去）"
          }
        }
