    "Tones from black on the left to white on the right: blacks, shadows, midtones, highlights, whites. Control-click to show the vectorscope.": {
      "comment": "UI display text. Keep numbered placeholders and keyboard shortcuts intact. Compositor/UI/CameraRawControls.swift",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tonwerte von Schwarz links bis Weiß rechts: Schwarz, Tiefen, Mitteltöne, Lichter, Weiß. Control-Klick zeigt das Vektorskop."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tones from black on the left to white on the right: blacks, shadows, midtones, highlights, whites. Control-click to show the vectorscope."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tonos desde el negro a la izquierda hasta el blanco a la derecha: negros, sombras, medios tonos, iluminaciones y blancos. Control-clic para mostrar el vectorscopio."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tons du noir à gauche au blanc à droite : noirs, tons foncés, tons moyens, tons clairs, blancs. Contrôle-clic pour afficher le vectorscope."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "左の黒から右の白へ、黒レベル、シャドウ、中間調、ハイライト、白レベルが並びます。Control-クリックでベクトルスコープを表示します。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "왼쪽 검정에서 오른쪽 흰색으로 검정, 어두운 영역, 중간 영역, 밝은 영역, 흰색이 나열됩니다. Control-클릭하면 벡터스코프를 표시합니다."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tons do preto à esquerda ao branco à direita: pretos, sombras, tons médios, realces e brancos. Control-clique para mostrar o vectorscópio."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "色调从左侧的黑到右侧的白，依次为黑色色阶、阴影、中间调、高光、白色色阶。按住 Control 单击可显示矢量示波器。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "色調從左側的黑到右側的白，依次為黑色色階、陰影、中間調、亮部、白色色階。按住 Control 按一下可顯示向量示波器。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
